---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="Our Vision">
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-hero px-6 pt-12 pb-20 lg:px-8 lg:pt-16 lg:pb-28">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1360px]">
      <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:items-center">
        <!-- Left Hero Content -->
        <div class="space-y-6 lg:col-span-7">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50/90 px-4 py-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-amber-900 shadow-sm backdrop-blur">
            <span class="flex h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-amber-500"></span>
            <span>Founder & Mentorship Philosophy</span>
          </div>

          <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl leading-[1.15]">
            Building Thinkers,<br />
            <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-orange-600 via-amber-500 to-amber-600 bg-clip-text text-transparent">Not Just Test-Takers.</span>
          </h1>

          <p class="max-w-2xl text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
            At NPconscious, we believe mathematics is not a collection of formulas to be memorized — it is the natural language of patterns, logic, and creativity.
          </p>

          <!-- Action Buttons -->
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center gap-3.5 pt-2">
            <a
              href="https://wa.me/918088276492?text=Hi%20Nikhil%2C%20I%20would%20love%20to%20connect%20and%20learn%20more%20about%20NPconscious."
              class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-orange-500 via-amber-500 to-amber-400 px-7 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-lg shadow-orange-500/25 transition hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-orange-500/35 hover:-translate-y-0.5 active:translate-y-0"
            >
              <span>Connect with Founder</span>
              <svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"/>
              </svg>
            </a>
            <a
              href="mailto:npconscious@gmail.com"
              class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-slate-300/80 bg-white px-7 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800 shadow-sm transition hover:bg-slate-50"
            >
              <span>Email Nikhil Directly</span>
            </a>
          </div>

          <!-- Stencil-inspired friendly badges -->
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 pt-4 text-xs font-medium text-slate-600">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-white px-3.5 py-1.5 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
              <span class="text-amber-500 font-bold">★</span> Information Science Engineer
            </span>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-white px-3.5 py-1.5 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
              <span class="text-amber-500 font-bold">★</span> Ex-Airbnb, Concentrix, Bhanzu
            </span>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-white px-3.5 py-1.5 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
              <span class="text-amber-500 font-bold">★</span> 100% Student-First Vision
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right Hero Visual -->
        <div class="relative lg:col-span-5">
          <div class="relative rounded-[2.5rem] border border-slate-200/80 bg-white p-4 shadow-soft">
            <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] bg-slate-50">
              <img
                src="/vision.png"
                alt="NPconscious learner-focused vision"
                class="w-full h-auto object-cover transition-transform duration-500 hover:scale-[1.02]"
              />
            </div>
            <div class="absolute -bottom-4 -right-2 sm:-bottom-5 sm:-right-4 rounded-2xl border border-amber-200 bg-white p-3.5 shadow-lg flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <span class="text-xl">🌟</span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-900">Curiosity-Led</p>
                <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Every learner is capable</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Core Pillars Section -->
  <section class="px-6 py-20 lg:px-8">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl space-y-12">
      <div class="text-center space-y-3">
        <span class="inline-block rounded-full bg-slate-100 px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-600">
          Core Pillars
        </span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-4xl">
          Learning Has No Age Limit
        </h2>
        <p class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-base text-slate-600">
          From a 5-year-old taking their first steps in counting to an adult exploring financial algorithms.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
        <div class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/90 bg-white p-8 shadow-soft transition hover:-translate-y-1">
          <div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 text-xl font-bold mb-5">
            01
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Curiosity First</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
            We actively encourage students to question formulas, explore alternate proofs, and develop healthy intellectual skepticism.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/90 bg-white p-8 shadow-soft transition hover:-translate-y-1">
          <div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-800 text-xl font-bold mb-5">
            02
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Math For Everyone</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
            From 5 to 105, anyone can understand mathematics when taught with empathy, patience, and visual mental models.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/90 bg-white p-8 shadow-soft transition hover:-translate-y-1">
          <div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 text-xl font-bold mb-5">
            03
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Conceptual Depth</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
            We never skip ahead until root concepts are crystal clear. Strong foundations turn complex problems into simple deductions.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- A Personal Letter from Founder Section -->
  <section class="px-6 py-16 lg:px-8">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl rounded-[3rem] border border-amber-200/70 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50/60 via-white to-amber-50/40 p-8 sm:p-14 shadow-soft">
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <span class="inline-block rounded-full bg-amber-100 px-3.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-amber-900">
          A Note to Parents & Learners
        </span>
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-slate-950">
          "Why I Started NPconscious"
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
          <p>
            Throughout school and college, I observed brilliant students lose their spark simply because mathematics was presented as an unforgiving gauntlet of rules and timed drills. The beauty of reasoning was lost under the weight of memorization.
          </p>
          <p>
            After working across top tech and education organizations like Bhanzu, Airbnb, and Concentrix, I realized that true learning happens when a student feels emotionally safe to say: <em>"I don’t understand this yet — can we look at it another way?"</em>
          </p>
          <p>
            That is why NPconscious was born in January 2026. Here, we celebrate the questions as much as the answers. We want our students to walk out of every session with their eyes wide open, excited to look at the world mathematically.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-6 border-t border-amber-200/60 flex items-center justify-between flex-wrap gap-4">
          <div>
            <p class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-base">Nikhil Parag</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Founder & Academic Director, NPconscious</p>
          </div>
          <a
            href="https://wa.me/918088276492?text=Hi%20Nikhil%2C%20I%20read%20your%20letter%20on%20the%20NPconscious%20site%20and%20would%20love%20to%20connect."
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-slate-900 px-5 py-2.5 text-xs font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-slate-800"
          >
            <span>Message Nikhil on WhatsApp</span>
            <span>&rarr;</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Bottom CTA -->
  <section class="px-6 py-16 lg:px-8">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl rounded-[3rem] bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-900 via-slate-950 to-slate-900 p-10 sm:p-16 text-center text-white shadow-2xl">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">
        Experience the Difference Firsthand
      </h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-base text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
        Join our growing family of curious learners. Book a free 1-on-1 demo session today.
      </p>
      <a
        href="https://wa.me/918088276492?text=Hi%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20book%20a%20free%20demo%20session!"
        class="mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-orange-500 to-amber-400 px-8 py-4 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-lg transition hover:scale-105"
      >
        <span>Book Free Demo</span>
        <span>&rarr;</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>

